     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Four classroom questions",
     "texto": [
      "These four phrases are useful in any Spanish class:\n\n- **¿Cómo se dice «table»?** to find out a word\n- **¿Cómo se escribe?** to find out the letters\n- **¿Qué significa?** to find out the meaning\n- **Más despacio, por favor.** to ask someone to repeat it\n\nAnd if you haven't understood a thing: **No entiendo.**"
